# No blanket `*.lock` rule here - a real mistake found 2026-08-10 while
# adding webview_flutter/url_launcher: it was quietly ignoring pubspec.lock
# too, which an *application* (not a published package) should commit for
# reproducible builds, per Flutter's own convention.

